2	line	Player	What has happened here?
2	line	Abigale	We were invited to a house party on an island not far from here... Something felt wrong about the whole thing but we went anyway...
2	line	Abigale	The house seemed pretty creepy, but everything was going fine, we were all having a good time...
2	line	Abigale	...and that's when we got attacked...
2	line	Hewey	I... I tried to save her...
2	line	Abigale	Hewey bought me enough time to find an old boat. I went back to get him but it was too late. I'm scared that he won't make it.
2	line	Abigale	You have to do something... they can't get away with this!
2	line	Player	What do you want me to do?
2	line	Abigale	That psycho is still out there, you have to bring them to justice.
2	line	Abigale	The boat we escaped on is just over there, you can use it to get to the island.
2	line	Player	Okay, I'll see what I can do.
2	action	end
