0	section	The second riddle
0	section	Run in with Lacey
1	line	Lacey	Please, stop this, just let me go!
1	line	Killer	We're going to play a game. Do you like to play games?
1	line	Lacey	No...yes....whatever you say, just don't hurt me!
1	line	Killer	Whether you get hurt or not is entirely up to you. Your fate is in your own hands.
1	line	Lacey	What!? What do you mean!?
1	line	Player	Leave her alone you monster!
1	line	Killer	Ah, {player}, how kind of you to join us. Now if you say another word, I will end her right now!
1	line	Killer	Sorry, where were we? Ah yes, of course! The game!
1	line	Killer	Do you like quests, Lacey?
1	line	Lacey	Ummm, sure, I like quests.
1	line	Killer	Do you like scary quests?
1	line	Lacey	Uh-huh.
1	line	Killer	What's your favourite scary quest?
1	line	Lacey	I don't know.
1	line	Killer	You have to have a favourite.
1	line	Lacey	Umm.....the one with that vampyre in it who lives in a big house.
1	line	Killer	Good, good. And now for that game I spoke about.
1	line	Killer	I am going to ask you one question. Get it wrong and you die, but get it right and you live.
1	line	Lacey	Oh Guthix please no, please don't, I don't want to die!
1	line	Killer	Then think hard about your answer. You like vampyres so this should be easy for you. The question is this...
1	line	Killer	Who is the Vampyre that resides in South Misthalin?
1	line	Lacey	Urm...
1	select	Interrupt with answer?
1	option	Count Draynor
2	line	Player	Count Draynor!
2	action	below
1	option	Count Check
2	line	Player	Count Check!
2	action	below
1	option	Lord Drakan
2	line	Player	Lord Drakan!
2	line	Killer	This game didn't involve you {player}! Now her death is on you! Her blood is on your hands you fool!
2	line	Lacey	Gargle...urgh...
2	action	below
1	option	Say nothing
2	line	Lacey	Oh yes, yes, I know it! Count Draynor!
2	line	Lacey	Ha, in your face you masked freak!
2	line	Killer	Oh Lacey, Lacey, Lacey. I did tell you to think hard about your answer.
2	line	Killer	Count Draynor is in fact a vampyre, and he does reside in his manor in Misthalin.
2	line	Killer	But that manor is in WEST Misthalin! I was talking about Count Check! Thanks for playing!
2	line	Lacey	No, no you tricked me! This isn't fair, ask me another...
2	line	Lacey	Gargle...urgh...
2	line	Player	That monster! I have to stop them! Let's see what that new note says.
2	action	end
