1	line	Mandy	Why am I the one who is always left clearing up after everyone?
1	line	Mandy	Hello? Anyone there?
1	line	Mandy	Hello? Lacey? Sid?
1	line	Mandy	Hmm, well I guess I should go check it out. No point staying in this nice, locked room when I could go outside into the creepy darkness.
1	line	Player	Seriously!?
1	box	The walls and door seem too thick for Mandy to be able to hear you.
1	line	Mandy	Oh, and I don't think there is any need to take this big, shiny weapon with me in order to defend myself. Nothing bad ever happens when people go check out noises in the dark outside of houses!
1	line	Player	You have got to be kidding...
1	line	Mandy	Ok, well, here I go!
1	line	Mandy	Hello, anyone out here?
1	line	Mandy	See, I knew nothing would happen! Must have just been a squirrel or something running about.
1	line	Mandy	Oh well, back to the dishes.
1	line	Player	Phew, that was lucky!
1	line	Mandy	No...why...me...
