0	section	Showdown
0	section	Confronting the killer
1	line	Player	Show yourself you coward!
1	line	Killer	So we meet at last. I have to say, I'm impressed you worked out my riddles.
1	line	Player	Well maybe you aren't as smart as you think you are.
1	line	Killer	Oh really? All the dead bodies suggest otherwise. And what did you do to stop them?
1	line	Killer	NOTHING!
1	line	Killer	People think you are some big hero but you're not. All you adventurers are the same. Nothing but opportunists!
1	line	Player	What are you going on about?
1	line	Killer	Well, I did have this big speech planned out but quite frankly I don't think you are worth the effort it would take to deliver it.
1	line	Killer	So, this is the end of the line for you. It is time for the final act. The showdown. The finale. Let's see if you are up to the challenge!
1	action	end
