2	line	Killer	Ouch!
0	section	Defeating the killer
1	line	Killer	Urgh...I think I may have underestimated you.
1	line	Player	You've lost at your own game. And now it is time to see who you really are under that mask!
1	line	Player	No! You!? But why!? Why on earth would you kill all your friends!? Why beg me to come here to help them!?
1	line	Abigale	You just don't get it do you?
1	line	Abigale	So big headed. So used to it all being about you. About you saving the day.
1	line	Abigale	Well I'm sick of it!
1	line	Player	What do you mean?
1	line	Abigale	Adventurers! You're all the same. Everything always has to be about you.
1	line	Player	I don't understand?
1	line	Abigale	Of course you wouldn't! Because you can't see past yourself!
1	line	Abigale	Believe it or not... I used to be like you.
1	line	Abigale	I'd hear about some damsel in distress and go to help. To have my moment. For me to be the hero, just for once.
1	line	Abigale	But YOU! You and every other darned adventurer! Every time I get there to help, it's too late. Crisis solved. Disaster averted. Reward claimed. Every time you and those other adventurers steal my moment!
1	line	Abigale	But not this time!
1	line	Abigale	This time, it is all about me! I'm the star of the show! ME ME ME ME ME!
1	line	Player	Well not any longer. The show is over, and there will be no curtain call.
1	line	Abigale	Oh, but there is always a curtain call.
1	line	Player	What!? How!? There was another killer!?
1	line	Abigale	Of course. Every good show needs a good supporting actor. Now, take off your mask darling. Take a bow. You have earned it.
1	line	Killer	Of course, my love.
1	line	Player	You!? But how!? You were almost dead when I saw you! I saw your wounds!
1	line	Hewey	No, what you watched was what we wanted you to watch. A masterful performance if I do say myself.
1	line	Player	But what is in this for you?
1	line	Hewey	Everyone loves the limelight, and who better to share it with than my beloved Abigale.
1	line	Player	But your friends?
1	line	Player	They didn't deserve to die!
1	line	Abigale	Perhaps not, but neither did I deserve to be cast back into the shadows when I deserve the spotlight!
1	line	Hewey	Yes, while we deserve the spotlight.
1	line	Abigale	And now I have my starring role!
1	line	Hewey	OUR starring role.
1	line	Abigale	Gielinor will forever remember this night and what I have done here.
1	line	Hewey	No, what WE have done!
1	line	Abigale	Quiet Hewey! This is my moment!
1	line	Hewey	No, this is supposed to be our moment! It isn't just all about you either! We were in this together!
1	line	Abigale	Stop ruining this Hewey! I have worked so hard for this and I'm not going to let you take it away from me!
1	line	Hewey	Well I'm not going to be pushed aside either, we were both in this as equals!
1	line	Abigale	We were never equals! How could you possibly compare to me!?
1	line	Hewey	You egotistical, selfish...
1	line	Hewey	No...my love...
1	line	Abigale	No....no...what have I done!?
1	line	Abigale	It wasn't supposed to be like this...but you just couldn't let me have my moment. WHY HEWEY WHY!? I loved you...
1	line	Player	This could be my chance to take advantage of the situation...
1	action	end
