1	line	Player	Wow, that was close!
1	line	Player	Mandy, how are you alive!? I watched you get stabbed through the heart!
1	line	Mandy	I did get stabbed, but I was born with a rare condition called Dextrocardia.
1	line	Player	Dextrowhat?
1	line	Mandy	Dextrocardia. It means that my heart is on the right side of my chest, not the left like most people.
1	line	Player	So when the killer thought they stabbed you in the heart, they actually missed?
1	line	Mandy	Well, missed the heart yes.
1	line	Mandy	I did still get stabbed though, and am actually feeling pretty woozy...
1	line	Player	Oh, yes, right! You should go sort yourself out!
1	line	Mandy	I will wait outside the house after seeing to this stab wound. You should come talk to me there.
